docs/requirements/decisions/session-ownership-and-write-leases.md-67-
docs/requirements/decisions/session-ownership-and-write-leases.md:68:- `sessionId`: stable identity for one agent session.
docs/requirements/decisions/session-ownership-and-write-leases.md-69-- `story owner lease`: exclusive right to run mutating commands for one story.
docs/requirements/decisions/session-ownership-and-write-leases.md-70-- `main write lock`: global lock for writes to main or shared metadata.
docs/requirements/decisions/session-ownership-and-write-leases.md-71-- `stale lease`: owner lease with heartbeat older than the configured threshold.
docs/requirements/decisions/session-ownership-and-write-leases.md-72-- `takeover`: explicit transfer of a story lease to another session.
docs/requirements/decisions/session-ownership-and-write-leases.md-73-- `read-only command`: command that does not mutate story, main, or B-META state.
docs/requirements/decisions/session-ownership-and-write-leases.md-74-- `mutating command`: command that writes story metadata, code, review evidence, findings, lifecycle state, or shared audit state.
